 "language_code": "en",
 "text": "Hey, if you're watching this, we probably just met. Maybe over a meal, maybe at a seminar. Either way, you're here. Again, I'm Hakeem Hooker. As a licensed fiduciary running FK Management, I hope people get clear on their money, where it is, what it's doing, and whether it's set up for the life that they want. Most people I meet aren't doing anything wrong. They're just busy. Life happens. Accounts pile up and nobody ever set them down and walk them through the whole picture. That's what I do. In plain talk. No pressure, no judgment. Working with me starts with a simple conversation. You tell me what matters to you. I'll tell you honestly what I see. Sometimes that means making a change. Sometimes that means you're already in good shape. So, save my contact right here on this card below. And when you're ready, book a time or just shoot me a text. I love to keep the conversation going. Talk soon.",
